WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:15.605
Zann's mind whirled as he finally got up to follow Venna.

2
00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:19.887
For a moment he thought he'd lost her—he couldn't hear or see her anywhere.

3
00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:23.428
Then he heard the soft clang of the airship door opening.

4
00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:27.190
As he neared the airship, Zann saw that the door was standing open.

5
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.391
He crept closer and peered in.

6
00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:31.772
Venna was inside with her back to him.

7
00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:33.965
She was pulling things out of a box.

8
00:00:34.365 --> 00:00:34.926
The relics!

9
00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:38.608
Zann watched as Venna gathered them into a large sack.

10
00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:45.113
He recognized a few of the relics—the Horn of the Otherworld, a scary-looking skull mask he guessed was

11
00:00:45.153 --> 00:00:48.255
the Mask of Zanta, and several others he'd studied in school.

12
00:00:48.275 --> 00:00:50.456
"Wow," he whispered.

13
00:00:51.157 --> 00:00:54.959
His teachers said the Horn alone held enough power to control all of Magica!

14
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.942
Venna slung the sack over her shoulder and then hurried toward the Cave.

15
00:01:00.003 --> 00:01:01.104
Zann wasn't sure what to do.

16
00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:05.110
It seemed Venna was planning to take the relics through the wormhole herself.

17
00:01:05.871 --> 00:01:08.432
If Zann followed her, she'd lead him to the wormhole.

18
00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.775
He could hide until she went through it and then jump through.

19
00:01:12.535 --> 00:01:14.777
He'd be on his way to search for his parents within minutes.

20
00:01:15.477 --> 00:01:19.160
But if he did that, he wouldn't have time to leave a message for Boz or his friends

21
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.120
about Venna's plan.

22
00:01:21.141 --> 00:01:22.142
And what if Tok was right?

23
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:26.925
What if the wormhole was too unstable to handle all those powerful relics passing through it?

24
00:01:27.745 --> 00:01:31.268
What if Venna accidentally blew up the entire cave and everyone nearby?

25
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.921
"Oh, man," Zann muttered.

26
00:01:34.602 --> 00:01:36.083
He had to warn Boz and the others.

27
00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:38.505
It was the only responsible thing to do.

28
00:01:39.305 --> 00:01:41.167
Zann turned and sprinted toward camp.

29
00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:44.289
"Are we there yet?"

30
00:01:44.589 --> 00:01:45.790
Perda wondered breathlessly.

31
00:01:46.531 --> 00:01:50.794
Zann and his friends were racing through a narrow tunnel behind Boz, Teplo, and several others.

32
00:01:51.554 --> 00:01:54.276
Magic energy was bouncing off the walls all around them.

33
00:01:54.977 --> 00:01:58.760
Despite the risks, the Magic Masters were using magic to lead them to Venna.

34
00:01:59.496 --> 00:02:01.957
Otherwise they were afraid they'd be too late to stop her.

35
00:02:01.977 --> 00:02:04.498
"Venna!" Uncle Gar shouted.

36
00:02:04.518 --> 00:02:05.658
"Where are you?"

37
00:02:06.878 --> 00:02:07.639
There was no answer.

38
00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:11.660
"This way," Boz said grimly, taking off down another tunnel.

39
00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.602
Zann's crawler squeaked a warning, and Zann ducked just in time to avoid a burst of energy.

40
00:02:17.622 --> 00:02:20.663
"Close one," Gliss exclaimed behind him.

41
00:02:21.423 --> 00:02:22.643
Zann nodded and kept going.

42
00:02:23.423 --> 00:02:25.144
They ran through one tunnel after another.

43
00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:29.991
Finally they all burst into a huge chamber dripping with stalactites.

44
00:02:30.871 --> 00:02:32.292
In the center stood Venna.

45
00:02:33.053 --> 00:02:34.534
"Stop!" Boz cried.

46
00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:36.856
"Venna, this is madness!"

47
00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:40.058
Venna glanced over her shoulder, looking surprised.

48
00:02:40.078 --> 00:02:43.641
"I don't care how risky it is," she cried.

49
00:02:43.661 --> 00:02:45.662
"I'm doing this for Magica!"

50
00:02:46.363 --> 00:02:50.385
Zann watched as Venna stepped forward and the wormhole swirled open.

51
00:02:51.106 --> 00:02:53.748
The edges flashed with silvery bursts of energy.

52
00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.162
"Douse!" Boz cried, rubbing his hands.

53
00:02:57.182 --> 00:03:00.564
"No!" Venna froze as the spell hit her.

54
00:03:01.245 --> 00:03:03.686
Without magic she couldn't go into the wormhole.

55
00:03:04.066 --> 00:03:06.388
She needed magic to navigate through the vortex.

56
00:03:06.408 --> 00:03:08.490
"This is an outrage!"

57
00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:09.490
Venna ranted.

58
00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:11.672
"You can't douse me!"

59
00:03:11.692 --> 00:03:16.115
"We'll remove the spell after you've listened to us," Teplo said.

60
00:03:16.135 --> 00:03:17.496
"I swear it.

61
00:03:17.836 --> 00:03:20.338
The final decision on what to do is yours."

62
00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:22.539
Venna scowled.

63
00:03:22.559 --> 00:03:25.633
"Fine. Say your piece.

64
00:03:25.713 --> 00:03:26.833
My mind is made up."

65
00:03:26.853 --> 00:03:31.294
"I don't think you comprehend the true risks," Boz said.

66
00:03:31.314 --> 00:03:35.175
"Those relics contain a stupendous amount of energy.

67
00:03:35.956 --> 00:03:41.277
Trying to take even one of them through this particular wormhole is a dangerous proposition.

68
00:03:41.657 --> 00:03:44.998
Taking them all—" "You could blow us to bits!"

69
00:03:45.539 --> 00:03:46.379
Uncle Gar finished.

70
00:03:47.439 --> 00:03:48.019
Venna blinked.

71
00:03:48.539 --> 00:03:50.240
"I I never thought about that.

72
00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.042
But I can't let you seal off these relics forever.

73
00:03:54.982 --> 00:03:57.183
Magica must be able to defend itself.

74
00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:59.345
I'm doing this for all of us."

75
00:04:00.165 --> 00:04:01.606
Teplo held out a hand to her.

76
00:04:01.626 --> 00:04:05.868
"If you feel that strongly, perhaps we can reopen the discussion.

77
00:04:06.628 --> 00:04:09.730
I won't speak for the others, but I'll listen to your arguments."

78
00:04:10.771 --> 00:04:12.332
"Me too," Boz said.

79
00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:13.572
The others nodded.

80
00:04:14.253 --> 00:04:15.994
Venna peered at them all suspiciously.

81
00:04:16.414 --> 00:04:17.835
Finally her expression softened.

82
00:04:17.855 --> 00:04:19.275
"All right.

83
00:04:19.615 --> 00:04:20.356
You have a deal."

84
00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.041
She handed the sack to Teplo.

85
00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:23.242
"Thank you."

86
00:04:23.542 --> 00:04:26.644
Teplo smiled at her and then pulled out the Horn of the Otherworld.

87
00:04:26.664 --> 00:04:28.966
"Magnificent," he murmured.

88
00:04:29.626 --> 00:04:30.507
He glanced at Boz.

89
00:04:30.527 --> 00:04:32.708
"Don't forget to remove the Dousing spell.

90
00:04:33.008 --> 00:04:35.350
Carefully." "Oh, yes."

91
00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.211
Boz rubbed his fingers together.

92
00:04:37.932 --> 00:04:41.134
At that moment all the crawlers let out a loud chirp.

93
00:04:41.154 --> 00:04:43.916
"Careful!" Perda blurted out.

94
00:04:44.696 --> 00:04:46.557
Friction sparked around Boz's fingers.

95
00:04:47.358 --> 00:04:50.240
A bolt of energy shot straight at the Horn of the Otherworld.

96
00:04:50.988 --> 00:04:53.249
The relic glowed and shuddered in Teplo's hand.

97
00:04:53.269 --> 00:04:55.610
"Duck!" Teplo shouted.

98
00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.292
Zann pressed himself against the wall as sparks shot from the horn.

99
00:05:00.312 --> 00:05:03.733
The wormhole glowed more brightly, and a tentacle of energy shot out.

100
00:05:04.594 --> 00:05:06.895
Venna screamed as the energy surrounded her.

101
00:05:07.635 --> 00:05:12.777
A second later the wormhole pulled her in, her scream still echoing off the chamber's walls.

102
00:05:13.597 --> 00:05:16.199
"Venna!" Boz cried, but it was too late.

103
00:05:16.219 --> 00:05:17.899
"Oh no!"

104
00:05:18.379 --> 00:05:19.400
Perda's face was white.

105
00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.981
"She was still under the Dousing spell!"

106
00:05:23.641 --> 00:05:24.941
There was an ominous rumble.

107
00:05:26.002 --> 00:05:29.503
Chunks of stone rained down, and the entire chamber shook.

108
00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:31.043
Tok gulped.

109
00:05:31.063 --> 00:05:33.444
"I think we just destabilized the Cave.

110
00:05:34.444 --> 00:05:35.304
Everybody run!"

111
00:05:35.324 --> 00:05:36.704
"Too late!"

112
00:05:37.065 --> 00:05:39.565
Teplo dropped the sack of relics and grabbed Perda's hand.

113
00:05:39.585 --> 00:05:41.786
"Join hands—quickly!"

114
00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:45.627
A small stalactite dropped and shattered at Zann's feet.

115
00:05:45.647 --> 00:05:50.440
"Hurry!" he shouted, grabbing Darb and Zing.

116
00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:52.101
Soon the entire group was holding hands.

117
00:05:52.121 --> 00:05:55.942
"Zap!" shouted all the Magic Masters in unison.

118
00:05:57.502 --> 00:06:01.964
Zann landed near the camp with the others just in time to see the entire cave collapse into

119
00:06:01.984 --> 00:06:02.724
a heap of rubble.

120
00:06:03.564 --> 00:06:05.885
He ducked as a stray bolt of energy shot over them.

121
00:06:06.705 --> 00:06:08.466
At first all he felt was relief.

122
00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:12.107
Then his heart sank as he realized what this meant.

123
00:06:12.847 --> 00:06:15.748
He'd just lost another chance to search for his parents.
